{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Behold Battle",
    "steam_appid": 2338910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.poster.avif?t=1726132094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.webm?t=1726132094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.mp4?t=1726132094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Guess which army will win, and watch them fight for your amusement. Behold Battle is a simple auto battler, where you see heroes and monsters fight to the death in randomly generated battles.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>- A normal game mode that has 20 rounds with increasing army complexity. Guess correctly to continue, or game over if you are wrong too many times.<br><br>- A simulator where you create both armies and watch them battle.<br><br>- 72 different units, some with unique attacks such as spawning undead minions.<br><br>- From small to gigantic battles, and many difficulties to test your prediction powers.<br><br>- Gold betting mode, and a spell mode where each side gets a random spell.<br><br>- Complete challenges to earn more spectators.<br><br><strong>Please note:</strong> Behold Battle uses the same art as Mage and Monsters, but has a very different core gameplay loop. It is a much more simple and casual game, where you judge how strong one army will be against another. Or just play around in the sandbox mode. A lot of time and care have gone into creating many different variations of this simple idea of guessing who will win. I have strived to make Behold Battle as polished as I can, so hopefully for many it is an intuitive, unique and enjoyable game.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.poster.avif?t=1726132094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.webm?t=1726132094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2338910/extras/b43ae3bf2e6236a7d0552e7bd896bb3b.mp4?t=1726132094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Guess which army will win, and watch them fight for your amusement. Behold Battle is a simple auto battler, where you see heroes and monsters fight to the death in randomly generated battles.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>- A normal game mode that has 20 rounds with increasing army complexity. Guess correctly to continue, or game over if you are wrong too many times.<br><br>- A simulator where you create both armies and watch them battle.<br><br>- 72 different units, some with unique attacks such as spawning undead minions.<br><br>- From small to gigantic battles, and many difficulties to test your prediction powers.<br><br>- Gold betting mode, and a spell mode where each side gets a random spell.<br><br>- Complete challenges to earn more spectators.<br><br><strong>Please note:</strong> Behold Battle uses the same art as Mage and Monsters, but has a very different core gameplay loop. It is a much more simple and casual game, where you judge how strong one army will be against another. Or just play around in the sandbox mode. A lot of time and care have gone into creating many different variations of this simple idea of guessing who will win. I have strived to make Behold Battle as polished as I can, so hopefully for many it is an intuitive, unique and enjoyable game.",
    "short_description": "Guess which army will win, and watch them fight for your amusement. Behold Battle is a simple auto battler, where you see heroes and monsters fight to the death in randomly generated battles.",
